---
description: |
  Normalizes a STIX 2.1 Indicator to OCSF 1.9 OSINT Inventory Info.

  ```tql
  stix::taxii::fetch "https://taxii.example.com/api-root/collections/indicators/objects/"
  where type == "indicator"
  stix::ocsf::normalize
  ```

  Use `stix::ocsf::map` when your pipeline holds the indicator under another
  field.
args:
  positional:
    - name: stix
      type: field
      default: this
      description: The STIX 2.1 Indicator.
  named:
    - name: into
      type: field
      default: this
      description: The field that receives the OCSF event.
---

$into.stix = $stix
stix::ocsf::map $into.stix, $into.ocsf
$into = $into.ocsf
